<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (                     The Coachella 2026 Live Music Festival Ticket Booking website is an HTML-based web project designed to provide users with a simple, interactive, and visually engaging platform for booking festival tickets online. The website presents essential information about the Coachella 2026 event, including artist lineups, event schedules, ticket categories, pricing details, and venue highlights. Using core HTML elements such as forms, tables, images, and hyperlinks, the project demonstrates how a static website can effectively simulate a real-world ticket booking system while ensuring user-friendly navigation and accessibility.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
