/Title (This project aims to enhance understanding of front-end web development concepts by implementing a structured layout and intuitive design focused on user experience. The ticket booking section allows users to select ticket types, enter personal details, and submit booking requests through HTML forms. Overall, the project showcases how HTML can be used to design a functional festival ticket booking interface, making it suitable for educational purposes and as a foundation for future enhancements using CSS and JavaScript.)
